  "assumptions": [
    "The system boundary is limited to the stroke-adjustment mechanism; hydraulic pressure source and press slide are represented as external source/sink components based on described interactions.",
    "The generic claimed connection means is modeled as the disclosed pressure-oil/bushing-interface effect; detailed supply hardware and fluid routing are not specified.",
    "Position detection is represented as sensors/limit switches based on the embodiment; signal destination and control logic are not specified."
  ],
